# Optional local drop-in for the training pipeline (Python env / COLMAP / training
# repos). Not shipped with the plugin. Anchored to the plugin root so that the
# third-party C++ sources under Source/<Module>/ThirdParty/ are still tracked.
/ThirdParty/

